      "instance_name": "cancer",
      "label": "Cancer",
      "description": "A group of diseases characterized by the uncontrolled growth and spread of abnormal cells, often leading to severe health complications and death. In the meme, cancer is referenced as a serious, life-threatening illness that is being humorously 'infected' by AIDS, which is a grotesque and medically inaccurate analogy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
