      "description": "The meme's text overlay 'what it looks like when cancer gets aids' is a medically inaccurate and offensive comparison. Cancer and AIDS are two distinct diseases with different causes and mechanisms. The meme uses this inaccuracy to create a darkly humorous or satirical image, but it does so at the expense of the dignity and suffering of real patients.",
